'''The Gelatin Mines''' (ところてん金鉱 ''Tokoroten Kinkō'', '''Tokoroten Jelly Gold Mine''') is the 21st sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 70th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 9.2 Update|Version 9.2]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is not very difficult except for [[Gas-Powered Birds|the third stage]] and possibly [[Stars in the Sewers|the fourth stage]].

{{LegendDiff|140|180|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces two new enemies:
*[[Urs & Fenrir (Enemy)|Urs & Fenrir]]: The [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[Ururun Wolf (Enemy)|Ururun Wolf]]. This variant Weakens, Curses, and has Omni Strike.
*[[Croconator]]: The [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[Croco]]. Overall a very weak enemy, but is usually spawned in droves.
This sub-chapter also includes a new obtainable unit, [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Urs &amp; Fenrir]]. They have a 30% chance to drop from the final stage (100% if a [[Treasure Radar]] is used).

